# OVL-1: the on-screen keyboard's typed line and caret. Types "qwe", moves the caret with the
# bumpers, types and deletes in the middle, then moves it with the arrow keys on the board.
tap lb 40
press guide
advance 100
tap west 60
release guide
advance 400
expect overlay showing keyboard
expect overlay keyboard.key KEY_Q
expect overlay keyboard.typed ""
tap south 60
tap right 40
tap south 60
tap right 40
tap south 60
advance 100
expect overlay keyboard.typed qwe
expect overlay keyboard.caret 3
# LB and RB move the caret (and send an arrow to the game).
tap lb 40
tap lb 40
expect overlay keyboard.caret 1
tap rb 40
expect overlay keyboard.caret 2
tap rb 40
tap rb 40
expect overlay keyboard.caret 3
# Typing at the caret inserts there.
tap lb 40
tap south 60
expect overlay keyboard.typed qwee
expect overlay keyboard.caret 3
# X is Backspace and takes the character before the caret.
tap west 60
expect overlay keyboard.typed qwe
expect overlay keyboard.caret 2
tap lb 40
tap lb 40
tap lb 40
expect overlay keyboard.caret 0
tap west 60
expect overlay keyboard.typed qwe
tap rb 40
tap west 60
expect overlay keyboard.typed we
expect overlay keyboard.caret 0
tap north 60
expect overlay keyboard.typed " we"
---
pad LeftBumper down        @0
pad LeftBumper up          @40
shifts mode Guide layers - @40
overlay none + info 1      @140
shifts mode - layers -     @140
overlay keyboard           @140
sound keyboard Open pop    @140
sound keyboard Pick pop    @600
